                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-sm relative overflow-hidden" style={`background: #5e96fc;`}>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,transparent,transparent_2px,rgba(255,255,255,0.4)_2px,rgba(255,255,255,0.4)_4px)]"></div>
                  </div>
                  <span data-i18n="planifai.pillar4.viz.legend3">Re-planificado</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.023 9.348h4.992v-.001M2.985 19.644v-4.992m0 0h4.992m-4.993 0l3.181 3.183a8.25 8.25 0 0013.803-3.7M4.031 9.865a8.25 8.25 0 0113.803-3.7l3.181 3.182" /></svg>
                <span class="text-xs text-amber-800 font-medium" data-i18n="planifai.pillar4.viz.result">Re-planificación parcial aplicada — solo 2 de 9 tareas movidas</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute -inset-3 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#f0f4ff] to-slate-50 rounded-3xl -z-10 opacity-60"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="planifai-icon-box planifai-icon-box-brand">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.023 9.348h4.992v-.001M2.985 19.644v-4.992m0 0h4.992m-4.993 0l3.181 3.183a8.25 8.25 0 0013.803-3.7M4.031 9.865a8.25 8.25 0 0113.803-3.7l3.181 3.182" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider" style={`color: ${accent};`} data-i18n="planifai.pillar4.tag">Resiliencia</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 mb-4" data-i18n="planifai.pillar4.title">Re-scheduling adaptativo</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-6" data-i18n="planifai.pillar4.desc">Cuando surgen disrupciones, el sistema ejecuta re-planificación parcial que mantiene la calidad de la solución sin recalcular el plan completo. El tratamiento probabilístico de incertidumbre garantiza decisiones robustas incluso con información incompleta.</p>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" style={`color: ${accent};`} fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
                <span class="text-sm text-slate-600" data-i18n="planifai.pillar4.li1">Re-scheduling parcial que preserva las tareas no afectadas</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" style={`color: ${accent};`} fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
                <span class="text-sm text-slate-600" data-i18n="planifai.pillar4.li2">Tratamiento probabilístico de incertidumbre integrado</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" style={`color: ${accent};`} fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
                <span class="text-sm text-slate-600" data-i18n="planifai.pillar4.li3">Reacciona a fallos de máquina, pedidos urgentes o retrasos de suministro en tiempo real</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ════════════════ FLUJO DE TRABAJO ════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 bg-[#f8f9fb] overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <div class="planifai-section-label mx-auto mb-5 reveal" data-i18n="planifai.workflow.label">Flujo de trabajo</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4 text-slate-800 reveal" data-i18n-html="planifai.workflow.title">
          Cómo funciona <span class="planifai-gradient-text">PlanifAI</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-lg reveal" data-i18n="planifai.workflow.subtitle">
          Tres etapas integradas que transforman datos crudos en decisiones operativas respaldadas cuantitativamente.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 Steps -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16">
        <div class="text-center reveal">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl text-white flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 text-2xl font-extrabold shadow-lg" style={`background: ${accent}; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px ${accent}33;`}>1</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2" data-i18n="planifai.workflow.step1.title">Predecir</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="planifai.workflow.step1.desc">Ingesta datos históricos y externos. El motor de IA anticipa patrones de demanda, optimiza niveles de stock y reduce costes operativos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center reveal" style="animation-delay:.1s">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl text-white flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 text-2xl font-extrabold shadow-lg" style={`background: ${accent}; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px ${accent}33;`}>2</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2" data-i18n="planifai.workflow.step2.title">Modelar</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="planifai.workflow.step2.desc">Define tu realidad operativa — recursos, restricciones, dependencias y calendarios — en un gemelo digital estructurado de tus procesos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center reveal" style="animation-delay:.2s">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl text-white flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 text-2xl font-extrabold shadow-lg" style={`background: ${accent}; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px ${accent}33;`}>3</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2" data-i18n="planifai.workflow.step3.title">Optimizar</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="planifai.workflow.step3.desc">El optimizador multiobjetivo calcula la mejor asignación de recursos y tareas en el tiempo, equilibrando objetivos contrapuestos y gestionando la incertidumbre.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Summary card -->
      <div class="planifai-glass rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto reveal">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="planifai-icon-box planifai-icon-box-brand flex-shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09zM18.259 8.715L18 9.75l-.259-1.035a3.375 3.375 0 00-2.455-2.456L14.25 6l1.036-.259a3.375 3.375 0 002.455-2.456L18 2.25l.259 1.035a3.375 3.375 0 002.455 2.456L21.75 6l-1.036.259a3.375 3.375 0 00-2.455 2.456z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2" data-i18n="planifai.workflow.summary.title">Un núcleo algorítmico diferencial</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="planifai.workflow.summary.desc">PlanifAI combina experiencia profunda en cadena de suministro con algoritmos de optimización propietarios capaces de modelar procesos reales y traducirlos en decisiones operativas óptimas. El resultado: mejor anticipación, planificación más precisa y decisiones respaldadas por criterios cuantitativos sólidos — fortaleciendo la competitividad y la resiliencia organizativa.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ════════════════ DEFENSA (BACSI) ════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 bg-[#f5f7fa] overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <div class="planifai-section-label mx-auto mb-5 reveal">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 6 3.75h2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 10.5 6v2.25a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H6a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25-2.25V6ZM3.75 15.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 6 13.5h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25 2.25V18a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H6A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 3.75 18v-2.25ZM13.5 6a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25-2.25H18A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 20.25 6v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 18 10.5h-2.25a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25-2.25V6ZM13.5 15.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25-2.25H18a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25 2.25V18A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 18 20.25h-2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 13.5 18v-2.25Z" /></svg>
          <span data-i18n="planifai.defense.label">Aplicaciones</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="reveal text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-800" data-i18n-html="planifai.defense.title">
          Aplicaciones en entorno <span class="planifai-gradient-text">Defensa (BACSI)</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
        {aplicacionesBacsi.map((app, index) => (
          <div class="planifai-card" style={`animation-delay: ${index * 80 + 100}ms;`}>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4" style={`background: ${accent}; color: #fff;`} data-i18n={`planifai.defense.app${index+1}.code`}>
              {app.code}
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3" data-i18n={`planifai.defense.app${index+1}.title`}>
              {app.title}
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed" data-i18n={`planifai.defense.app${index+1}.desc`}>{app.description}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- Caso de uso destacado -->
      <div class="reveal delay-100">
        <div class="planifai-card !p-8 md:!p-10">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-10">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4" style={`background: ${accent}; color: #fff;`} data-i18n="planifai.defense.caso.code">
                {casoUsoDestacado.code}
              </span>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3" data-i18n="planifai.defense.caso.title">{casoUsoDestacado.title}</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="planifai.defense.caso.desc">{casoUsoDestacado.description}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 md:w-1/3 flex items-center">
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed italic border-l-2 pl-4" style={`border-color: ${accent}44;`} data-i18n="planifai.defense.caso.note">
                {casoUsoDestacado.note}
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ════════════════ CTA ════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 overflow-hidden bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-10 items-center">
            <!-- Left: text + buttons -->
            <div class="text-center md:text-left">
              <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-800 mb-5" data-i18n-html="planifai.cta.title">¿Quieres evaluar <span class="planifai-gradient-text">PlanifAI</span> en tu caso de uso?
              </h2>
              <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 mb-8" data-i18n="planifai.cta.desc">
                Podemos preparar una demo personalizada con tus procesos, recursos y objetivos, y estimar el impacto en tiempo de planificación, costes y utilización de activos.
              </p>
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center md:items-start justify-center md:justify-start gap-4">
                <a href={`${base}#contact`} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm tracking-wide transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg" style={`background: ${accent}; color: #fff;`}><span data-i18n="planifai.cta.button">Contactar</span>
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" /></svg>
                </a>
                <button type="button" disabled class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm tracking-wide border border-slate-200 transition-all duration-300 text-slate-400 bg-white cursor-not-allowed">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-6-6zm-1 2l5 5h-5V4zm-2.5 9.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h4a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-4a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5zm-3 0a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h1a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-1a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5zm0 3a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h7a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-7a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5z"/>
                  </svg><span data-i18n="planifai.cta.button.disabled">Descargar dossier</span>
                </button>
                <a href={`${base}#products`} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm tracking-wide border border-slate-300 text-slate-600 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:border-slate-400" data-i18n="planifai.cta.button.secondary">Ver todos los productos
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right: QR vCard placeholder -->
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
              <div class="w-36 h-36 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center p-3">
                <!-- QR placeholder -->
                <div class="w-full h-full rounded-lg bg-slate-50 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-slate-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 4.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h4.5c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v4.5c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-4.5A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 3.75 9.375v-4.5ZM3.75 14.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h4.5c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v4.5c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-4.5a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125v-4.5ZM13.5 4.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h4.5c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v4.5c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-4.5A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 13.5 9.375v-4.5Z" />
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 6.75h.75v.75H6v-.75ZM6 16.5h.75v.75H6v-.75ZM16.125 6.75h.75v.75h-.75v-.75ZM13.5 13.5h.75v.75h-.75v-.75ZM13.5 19.125h.75v.75h-.75v-.75ZM19.125 13.5h.75v.75h-.75v-.75ZM19.125 19.125h.75v.75h-.75v-.75ZM16.125 16.125h.75v.75h-.75v-.75Z" />
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-[9px] font-semibold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider" data-i18n="planifai.cta.qr.label">QR vCard</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium" data-i18n="planifai.cta.qr.scan">Escanea para contactar</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  </div><!-- /planifai-page -->
</Layout>
